[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/28.tres]史实 vs 演义[/font][/b]


[color=#000000]演义[/color]（嘉靖本、毛本）中皇甫嵩形象与正史较为一致，出场约5处：

[indent]1.  讨伐黄巾，火攻大破张梁、张宝[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]2.  接替董卓北讨张角，连胜七阵，斩张梁[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]3.  掘张角棺，戮尸枭首，传首京师[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]4.  拜左车骑将军、领冀州牧[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]5.  晚年官至太尉，出场颇少[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


